{
    "title": "Fever: Local Events & Tickets",
    "description": "<b>Discover the best experiences in your city\ud83d\udccd</b>\r\nFever puts the wealth of your city\u2019s events and experiences at your fingertips. Discover what to do, where to go, and what to visit. Find local events, secret places, and trendy pop-ups, some of which are available exclusively on Fever. \r\n\r\nDiscover exclusive events that you can only find in Fever:\r\n\r\n\ud83e\udd95 Jurassic World: The Exhibition\r\n\ud83d\udc7e Stranger Things: The Experience\r\n\ud83c\udfa8 Van Gogh: the Immersive Experience\r\n\ud83d\udc51The Queens Ball: A Bridgerton Experience\r\n\u2728 And many more!\r\n\r\n<h2>Unique Fever features</h2>\r\n\ud83c\udf89<b>Exclusive events</b>: Access to exclusive events that you can only find on the Fever platform.\r\n\u2b50 <b>Fever Club</b>: Reward system on all ticket purchases thanks to your Fever wallet.\r\n\u23e9 <b>Fever filters</b>: Handy filters that allow you to search by date & time.\r\n\u2763\ufe0f <b>Favorite events</b>: List of favorited experiences for easy access to the events that you like the most.\r\n\ud83c\udfab <b>Ticket transfers</b>: Easy ticket transfer system that allows you to send friends and family tickets with no fuss.\r\n\ud83d\udccd <b>Map of event locations</b>: Up-to-date map that shows you the events near you and in your city.\r\n\ud83d\ude4b <b>User based recommendations</b>: Personalized recommendations for events and experiences based on your likes.\r\n\ud83d\udcf1 <b>Fully mobile, paper-free tickets</b>: no printer required as tickets are scanned from your mobile device.\r\n\ud83d\udd27 <b>Customer Support</b>: 24/7 support and chat with our Customer Support team, available in 8 languages.\r\n\r\n<h2>All types of events and experiences</h2>\r\n\u261b <b>Tours, trips, adventure</b>: discover new places and experiences in your city that you haven\u2019t even heard of.\r\n\u261b <b>Arts & museums</b>: visit your city\u2019s cultural havens for a tranquil day out.\r\n\u261b <b>Concerts & festivals</b>: watch your favorite musicians and artists as they perform at some of the most exclusive venues in your city.\r\n\u261b <b>Theater, comedy, shows, & AMC cinemas</b>: laugh, cry, sing and shout at the best shows and latest movie screenings.\r\n\u261b <b>Food experiences</b>: taste the world at a wide variety of gastronomic experiences.\r\n\u261b <b>Drinks & afterwork, nightlife, parties</b>: dance the night away at some of the city\u2019s hottest nighttime spots.\r\n\u261b <b>And much more!</b>\r\n\r\n<b>Available cities in the US</b>: New York, San Francisco, Los Angeles, Miami, Boston, Chicago, San Diego, Washington DC, Atlanta, Philadelphia, Seattle and many more!\r\n\r\nTo check out the Fever platform and for any other information, you can take a look at our website <a href=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https%3A%2F%2Ffeverup.com%2Fen&sa=D&sntz=1&usg=AOvVaw1ojz35hwihfstN-LB3kQmx\">https://feverup.com/en</a> or contact us 24/7 support via chat, phone and email at hi@feverup.com.",
    "descriptionHTML": "<b>Discover the best experiences in your city\ud83d\udccd</b><br>Fever puts the wealth of your city\u2019s events and experiences at your fingertips. Discover what to do, where to go, and what to visit. Find local events, secret places, and trendy pop-ups, some of which are available exclusively on Fever. <br><br>Discover exclusive events that you can only find in Fever:<br><br>\ud83e\udd95 Jurassic World: The Exhibition<br>\ud83d\udc7e Stranger Things: The Experience<br>\ud83c\udfa8 Van Gogh: the Immersive Experience<br>\ud83d\udc51The Queens Ball: A Bridgerton Experience<br>\u2728 And many more!<br><br><h2>Unique Fever features</h2><br>\ud83c\udf89<b>Exclusive events</b>: Access to exclusive events that you can only find on the Fever platform.<br>\u2b50 <b>Fever Club</b>: Reward system on all ticket purchases thanks to your Fever wallet.<br>\u23e9 <b>Fever filters</b>: Handy filters that allow you to search by date &amp; time.<br>\u2763\ufe0f <b>Favorite events</b>: List of favorited experiences for easy access to the events that you like the most.<br>\ud83c\udfab <b>Ticket transfers</b>: Easy ticket transfer system that allows you to send friends and family tickets with no fuss.<br>\ud83d\udccd <b>Map of event locations</b>: Up-to-date map that shows you the events near you and in your city.<br>\ud83d\ude4b <b>User based recommendations</b>: Personalized recommendations for events and experiences based on your likes.<br>\ud83d\udcf1 <b>Fully mobile, paper-free tickets</b>: no printer required as tickets are scanned from your mobile device.<br>\ud83d\udd27 <b>Customer Support</b>: 24/7 support and chat with our Customer Support team, available in 8 languages.<br><br><h2>All types of events and experiences</h2><br>\u261b <b>Tours, trips, adventure</b>: discover new places and experiences in your city that you haven\u2019t even heard of.<br>\u261b <b>Arts &amp; museums</b>: visit your city\u2019s cultural havens for a tranquil day out.<br>\u261b <b>Concerts &amp; festivals</b>: watch your favorite musicians and artists as they perform at some of the most exclusive venues in your city.<br>\u261b <b>Theater, comedy, shows, &amp; AMC cinemas</b>: laugh, cry, sing and shout at the best shows and latest movie screenings.<br>\u261b <b>Food experiences</b>: taste the world at a wide variety of gastronomic experiences.<br>\u261b <b>Drinks &amp; afterwork, nightlife, parties</b>: dance the night away at some of the city\u2019s hottest nighttime spots.<br>\u261b <b>And much more!</b><br><br><b>Available cities in the US</b>: New York, San Francisco, Los Angeles, Miami, Boston, Chicago, San Diego, Washington DC, Atlanta, Philadelphia, Seattle and many more!<br><br>To check out the Fever platform and for any other information, you can take a look at our website <a href=\"https://www.google.com/url?q=https%3A%2F%2Ffeverup.com%2Fen&amp;sa=D&amp;sntz=1&amp;usg=AOvVaw1ojz35hwihfstN-LB3kQmx\">https://feverup.com/en</a> or contact us 24/7 support via chat, phone and email at hi@feverup.com.",
